# IoT Environmental Monitoring System

An ESP32-based environmental monitoring project designed to collect
temperature, humidity, dust, and air-quality readings using sensors.

## Hardware Components

- ESP32 development board
- DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor
- DS18B20 temperature sensor
- MQ-135 air-quality sensor
- PM2.5 dust sensor
- OLED display

## Project Structure

- `src/` — Main Arduino source code
- `sensor_calibration/` — Sensor calibration code
- `Datasheets/` — Component datasheets and pinout references
- `images/` — Project images

## Tools and Technologies

- ESP32
- Arduino C++
- Environmental sensors 
- Embedded systems

